<chapter xml:id="ch-thinking-strategies" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Thinking Strategies and Mental Math</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      We saw all of the arithmetic operations in <xref ref="ch-numbers"/>.
      We continue with many of the ideas there to improve the thinking strategies.
      The ability to do mathematical operations in one’s head is an important skill and is often called <em>Mental Math</em>.
    </p>
  </introduction>

